        <detaileddescription>
<para>Creates a new project and return the local path of the project file.</para>
<para>The available <emphasis>options</emphasis> are:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>title: the project title</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>basemap: the basemap type (color, lightgray, darkgray, custom, blank)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>basemap_url: a custom basemap URL (XYZ raster layer or vector tile layer style JSON)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>notes: set to TRUE to add a notes layer</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>camera_capture: set to TRUE to add an image/video capture field to the notes layer</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>tracks: set to TRUE to add a tracks layer</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>track_on_launch: set to TRUE to start tracking position on project launch </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
